{
 "title": "Deep Work, lesson 1: the skill nobody practises",
 "beats": [
  {
   "say": "The most valuable skill at work? Almost nobody practises it.",
   "scene": "intro",
   "theme": "dark",
   "transition": "cut",
   "p": {
    "hook": "THE SKILL NOBODY PRACTISES",
    "accent": [
     "NOBODY"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "It's the ability to focus on one hard thing.",
   "scene": "icon",
   "theme": "amber",
   "transition": "zoom_through",
   "p": {
    "icon": "target",
    "title": "FOCUS",
    "sub": "one hard thing, fully",
    "chips": [
     "One task",
     "No pings",
     "No tabs"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Cal Newport calls it deep work. Its opposite is shallow work.",
   "scene": "versus",
   "theme": "light",
   "transition": "whip_left",
   "p": {
    "left": {
     "t": "DEEP WORK",
     "sub": "hard thinking, no distractions",
     "icon": "brain"
    },
    "right": {
     "t": "SHALLOW",
     "sub": "emails and busywork",
     "icon": "mail"
    },
    "win": "left"
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Jason Benn taught himself to code through deep, undistracted study. Then he became a developer.",
   "scene": "timeline",
   "theme": "dark",
   "transition": "whip_up",
   "p": {
    "title": "DEEP FOCUS IN ACTION",
    "items": [
     {
      "t": "Finance job",
      "sub": "mostly spreadsheets",
      "on": "jason"
     },
     {
      "t": "Deep study",
      "sub": "taught himself to code",
      "on": "deep"
     },
     {
      "t": "Developer role",
      "sub": "hired as a developer",
      "on": "developer"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Quality equals time multiplied by intensity of focus.",
   "scene": "list",
   "theme": "dark",
   "transition": "circle",
   "p": {
    "title": "THE FOCUS FORMULA",
    "items": [
     {
      "t": "Quality of work",
      "icon": "star",
      "on": "quality"
     },
     {
      "t": "= Time spent",
      "icon": "clock",
      "on": "time"
     },
     {
      "t": "x Intensity",
      "icon": "fire",
      "on": "intensity"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "One truly focused hour can beat several distracted ones.",
   "scene": "meter",
   "theme": "amber",
   "transition": "wipe_diag",
   "p": {
    "title": "WHAT GETS DONE",
    "rows": [
     {
      "label": "3 distracted hours",
      "value": 55
     },
     {
      "label": "1 focused hour",
      "value": 100,
      "hl": true
     }
    ],
    "max": 100,
    "suffix": "%",
    "note": "illustration"
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Why? Researcher Sophie Leroy found something she calls attention residue.",
   "scene": "icon",
   "theme": "dark",
   "transition": "push_up",
   "p": {
    "icon": "cloud",
    "title": "ATTENTION RESIDUE",
    "sub": "Sophie Leroy, researcher"
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Switch tasks, and part of your attention stays stuck on the last one.",
   "scene": "donut",
   "theme": "light",
   "transition": "flip",
   "p": {
    "title": "WHERE YOUR ATTENTION IS",
    "center": "SPLIT",
    "segments": [
     {
      "label": "On this task",
      "value": 60
     },
     {
      "label": "Stuck on the last",
      "value": 40
     }
    ],
    "suffix": "%",
    "note": "illustration"
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Even a quick inbox check leaves a fog that takes a while to clear.",
   "scene": "chart",
   "theme": "dark",
   "transition": "whip_right",
   "p": {
    "kind": "line",
    "title": "YOUR FOCUS",
    "points": [
     100,
     30,
     48,
     64,
     80,
     92
    ],
    "labels": [
     "",
     "INBOX",
     "",
     "",
     "",
     ""
    ],
    "end_label": "BACK",
    "caption": "an illustration of attention residue"
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Meanwhile, most of us are interrupted all day long.",
   "scene": "dots",
   "theme": "amber",
   "transition": "push_up",
   "p": {
    "total": 10,
    "hl": 8,
    "big": "MOST OF US",
    "label": "INTERRUPTED ALL DAY",
    "note": "illustration"
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "So deep work gets rarer, exactly as it gets more valuable.",
   "scene": "chart",
   "theme": "dark",
   "transition": "glitch",
   "p": {
    "kind": "compound",
    "up_label": "WHAT IT'S WORTH",
    "down_label": "HOW MANY DO IT",
    "up_end": "MORE",
    "down_end": "LESS",
    "caption": "an illustration, not data"
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "That gap is your career opportunity.",
   "scene": "slam",
   "theme": "amber",
   "transition": "scale_back",
   "p": {
    "lines": [
     "THAT GAP",
     "IS YOUR",
     "OPPORTUNITY"
    ],
    "accent": [
     "OPPORTUNITY"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "say": "Start small tomorrow. Protect one distraction-free hour for your hardest task.",
   "scene": "list",
   "theme": "light",
   "transition": "whip_left",
   "p": {
    "title": "TOMORROW",
    "items": [
     {
      "t": "One hour",
      "icon": "clock",
      "on": "hour"
     },
     {
      "t": "Zero distractions",
      "icon": "lock",
